<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>ONISUBI | Privacy Policy</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css"></head><body><main class="cart-page"><div class="container"><article class="panel legal-page"><a class="text-link" href="index.php">&larr; Back to ONISUBI</a><h1>ONISUBI PRIVACY POLICY</h1><p>Onisubi respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you provide when using our website.</p><p>This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected, how it is used, and how it is protected.</p><h2>1. Information We Collect</h2><p>When you create an account or place an order, Onisubi may collect information such as:</p><ul><li>Full name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Contact number</li><li>Delivery or pickup information</li><li>Account login information</li><li>Order details</li><li>Order ID</li><li>Payment-related information necessary to process or identify an order</li></ul><p>We only collect information that is reasonably necessary for the functions of the website.</p><h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2><p>The information collected may be used to:</p><ul><li>Create and manage your customer account</li><li>Process and manage orders</li><li>Generate and identify your Order ID</li><li>Provide delivery or pickup services</li><li>Process or confirm payments through the applicable payment service</li><li>Provide order status and tracking</li><li>Respond to customer inquiries</li><li>Improve the website and its services</li><li>Maintain website security and prevent fraudulent or unauthorized activity</li></ul><h2>3. Payment Information</h2><p>If GCash or another payment service is used, payment processing may be handled by the applicable third-party payment provider.</p><p>Onisubi should only retain payment information that is necessary for order processing, identification, or record-keeping.</p><p>Sensitive payment credentials, such as account passwords or PINs, should not be collected or stored by the Onisubi website.</p><h2>4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2><p>The website may use cookies, browser storage, or similar technologies to support functions such as:</p><ul><li>Maintaining login sessions</li><li>Remembering cart information</li><li>Improving website functionality</li></ul><p>Customers may manage browser permissions for cookies and storage through their browser settings, although disabling certain features may affect website functionality.</p><h2>5. Data Sharing</h2><p>Onisubi does not sell customer personal information.</p><p>Information may be shared only when necessary to provide a requested service, such as processing a payment through the designated payment provider, completing an order, or complying with applicable legal requirements.</p><h2>6. Data Security</h2><p>Onisubi takes reasonable measures to protect customer information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or misuse.</p><p>However, no online system can guarantee absolute security.</p><h2>7. Data Retention</h2><p>Customer information and order records may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to provide services, maintain order records, operate the system, resolve disputes, or comply with applicable requirements.</p><h2>8. Your Privacy Rights</h2><p>Subject to applicable law and the circumstances of the request, customers may have rights regarding their personal information, including the right to request access to, correction of, or appropriate deletion of their information.</p><p>Customers may contact the Onisubi team for privacy-related concerns or requests.</p><h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2><p>The Onisubi website is intended for customers who are able to legally use the service and provide the required information.</p><p>If information is provided by a minor, appropriate consent should be obtained from a parent or legal guardian where required.</p><h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2><p>Onisubi may update this Privacy Policy when necessary.</p><p>Changes will be posted on this page together with the updated "Last Updated" date.</p><h2>11. Contact Us</h2><p>For questions, concerns, or requests regarding your personal information or this Privacy Policy, customers may contact the Onisubi team through the contact information provided on the website.</p><p>By using the Onisubi website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.</p></article></div></main></body></html>